    {
      "name": "evaluation",
      "title": "Evaluation",
      "summary": "No single model wins everywhere: 2 different models take first place across the four series. Best mean rank is SARIMA(1,1,1)(1,1,1,m) at 1.5, but it wins outright on only 3 of 4.",
      "decisions": [
        {
          "question": "Is there a default model to recommend?",
          "choice": "SARIMA(1,1,1)(1,1,1,m) as a first attempt, but structure should decide.",
          "rationale": "Mean rank across four structurally different series is a weak recommendation by construction. The per-series table is the real result: a model that dominates on calendar-seasonal data can rank last on a series whose cycle is not calendar-anchored.",
